+### GLM-5.3-Flash BF16 on MetaX
+
+Text bring-up is verified on two hosts with eight C550 64 GiB devices each,
+using TP8/PP2 and `FULL_AND_PIECEWISE`. Formal accuracy and performance
+acceptance are pending. Image/video inference and speculative decoding are
+not validated. Pure `FULL` is unavailable with the current MLA/indexer backend.
+
+The tested dependency bases are vLLM
+`ee0da84ab9e04ac7610e28580af62c365e898389`, FlagGems
+`3eab0949b9beea777e910ff8666b9ef53081d35c`, and FlagGems-vllm
+`ddce1d66c98cfdbdcfff36364f3d10e3af9d499c`, with PyTorch
+`2.10.0+metax3.8.2.2` and FlagTree `0.7.0+metax`.
+The model integration also requires the associated local Plugin, FlagGems
+clone-registration, and FlagGems-vllm MetaX/canonical-top-k patches; these
+patches are not implied by the upstream base SHAs. Use the tested adapted
+image or restore the frozen patch set from its deployment manifest.
+Installing the unmodified dependency bases alone is insufficient.
+
+Set `MODEL_PATH` to the BF16 checkpoint directory, `MASTER_ADDR` to the
+first host's reachable address, `VLLM_HOST_IP` to this host's address,
+`NODE_RANK` to 0 or 1, and `COMM_IFACE` to their communication interface.
+Both hosts need the same model, tokenizer and installed component contents.
+Start rank 1 first, then rank 0, with the same command (rank 1 adds `--headless`):
+
+```bash
+export MCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME="$COMM_IFACE" GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME="$COMM_IFACE"
+export VLLM_FL_USE_FLAGGEMS_VLLM=1 OMP_NUM_THREADS=1
+role=()
+if [ "$NODE_RANK" = 1 ]; then role=(--headless); fi
+python -m vllm.entrypoints.cli.main serve "$MODEL_PATH" \
+  --served-model-name glm5.3-flash --dtype bfloat16 \
+  --tensor-parallel-size 8 --pipeline-parallel-size 2 \
+  --distributed-executor-backend mp --nnodes 2 --node-rank "$NODE_RANK" \
+  --master-addr "$MASTER_ADDR" --master-port 29653 \
+  --max-model-len 65536 --max-num-seqs 8 --max-num-batched-tokens 2048 \
+  --mamba-cache-mode align --reasoning-parser glm45 \
+  --compilation-config '{"cudagraph_mode":"FULL_AND_PIECEWISE"}' \
+  --host 0.0.0.0 --port 18530 --enable-prefix-caching "${role[@]}"
+```
+
+After the first host reports readiness, run the real request example:
+
+```bash
+python examples/glm5_3_flash_chat.py \
+  --endpoint http://127.0.0.1:18530/v1/chat/completions
+```
+
